      R. Q. 2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَحَلْحَلَ عَنْ مَكَانِهِ</span></b>  <i>He removed from
his place;</i> or <i>quitted it.</i> (S.) And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَحَلْحَلُوا</span>
<i>They removed from their places, and became in
motion,</i> (K, TA,) <i>and went away.</i> (TA.)

